  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska institutet 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish institute 2010 - Sv institutet 2010-12</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 St&#xF6;d till Svenska institutet f&#xF6;r utbytesprogram med ODA-l&#xE4;nder, ett program som f&#xE5;tt Sidas st&#xF6;d sedan 1988. 2010 f&#xE5;r programmet 1 &#xE5;rs st&#xF6;d i avvaktan p&#xE5; ny strategi f&#xF6;r globala program samt bed&#xF6;mning av framtid, ev utfasning/&#xF6;verfasning till annan strategikomponent &#xE4;n den &#xE4;mnesstrategiska (t ex akt&#xF6;rssamverkan). Programmet utv&#xE4;rderades 2009.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Swedish Institute for cultural exchange programme with ODA-countries, a programme that Sida has supported since 1988. A one year support is given 2010, awaiting the new strategy for global programmes which is planned for during 2010. Discussion will be held re the future of the programme (phase out Sida&apos;s support or phase over to different strategy, e.g. partner driven cooperation).</narrative>
  </description>
